My friends and I gathered our action figures and acted out the scenes as accurately as we could remember. This was pre-internet and before most of us even had VHS, so we kept the movie alive as an oral tradition like “The Iliad.” I was about 10 and when I looked up at the night sky, I wanted to BE one of those action figures.
