Colorado Access Hires Robert King as its First Vice President of Diversity, Equity and Inclusion - Colorado Access Skip to main content
Colorado Access Hires Robert King as its First Vice President of Diversity, Equity and Inclusion
DENVER – June 7, 2021 – Colorado Access announces the appointment of Robert “Bobby” King as its vice president of diversity, equity and inclusion (DEI). In this newly created position, King will work directly with Colorado Access President and CEO Marshall Thomas, MD, and be responsible for strategic leadership, direction and accountability for internal and external DEI initiatives.
In his first 90 days, King will immerse himself in the company’s vision, mission, strategy and goals, ensuring that its DEI strategy is integrated and aligned with existing work. He will work to understand the current organizational state, culture and environment; evaluate readiness for change, current systems and measures; and optimize the existing DEI committee, governance and communication strategy.
