The next window will let you know basic information about your device and would give either Backup or Restore option. Click on the “Backup” button.
The tool will detect different kinds of data files that are available for backup. Simply select the ones you like to backup.
Press the “Backup” button for the process to start. It will let you know the progress of it as well.
The tool will notify you as soon as the backup is completed. You can select “View the backup” to get a glimpse of your recently performed task.
