FRANK told you how to choose a bathroom cabinet
How to choose a bathroom cabinet FRANK allows you to choose a good product .
The materials are mainly stone , glass , metal , ceramic , solid wood , plate and pvc .
At present , the most popular products are PVC bathroom cabinets and solid wood bathroom cabinets .
Tip 1: The base material of the bathroom cabinet must be environmentally friendly materials .
Therefore , the base material of the bathroom cabinet must be environmentally friendly material .
Tip 2: Which bathroom cabinet brand is better , there is no absolute answer to this question .
Tip three : Solid wood bathroom cabinets , mostly better solid wood bathroom cabinets , mostly oak as the main substrate , using waterproof and environmental protection paint spray treatment , compared with other artificial boards , solid wood cabinets have lower formaldehyde emission , natural environmental protection , also Stronger and more durable .
Tip five : PVC bathroom cabinets , using PVC as a plastic panel , are adsorbed on a density board or a moisture-proof board after vacuum hot pressing.The moisture-proof board is a cured product of moisture-proof particles .
But chemical resistance is not high .
I hope to help you better understand solid wood bathroom cabinet
Olfactory discrimination method : Most solid woods have woody fragrance , pine has pine resin smell , camphor wood has obvious camphor smell , but fiberboard and density board will have a strong irritating smell , especially in the cabinet door or inside .
Tactile discrimination method : put your hand on the cabinet surface , carefully check whether the polished surface is smooth , especially pay attention to the legs .
Sound discrimination method : tap the cabinet door with your hand if the sound is crisp , it means that the cabinet material is good in manufacturing process and quality ; if the sound is dull , dumb , and there are crackling noises , it means that the material or mortise is not well combined , and the quality is average .
The manufacturer of the bathroom cabinet generally pays attention to the varnish or matt paint for the solid wood bathroom cabinet to express the natural color of the wood .
