How to protect bathroom mirrors against rust and cracks?
Bathroom mirrors can easily rust , corrode the mirror surface , and produce mildew rust spots in a wet bathroom environment .
Then , in daily life , it is necessary to maintain the bathroom mirror frequently to avoid the above-mentioned situation .
So in a wet bathroom environment , how should the mirror be cleaned ?
Before bathing , you can apply soap to the mirror surface and then wipe with a dry cloth .
The mirror surface should be wiped with a soft dry cloth or cotton to prevent the mirror surface from being shaved .
Use a soft cloth or feather to dust off the surface of the frame .
